  "label": "transgender community is mapped onto chaotic vehicle",
  "description": "The text 'this transgendershit is getting outta hand' explicitly maps the transgender community (via the slur 'transgendershit') onto the visual entity of the dilapidated, mismatched truck, which is used as a metaphor for being 'out of hand'. The truck's chaotic, broken, and neglected state visually represents the hostility and dehumanization expressed in the text towards transgender individuals.",
